    {
      "flavor_text": "ひかりや　ショックを　きらう。\nこうげきされると　からだが　ふくらみ\nはんげきが　きょうりょくに　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "빛과 쇼크를 싫어한다.\n공격받으면 몸이 부풀어 올라\n반격이 강력해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il déteste la lumière et les chocs. S’il est attaqué,\nil se gonflera pour riposter violemment.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hasst Licht und Schläge. Wird es angegriffen,\npumpt es sich auf, um einen Gegenschlag\nvorzubereiten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Odia la luz y las sacudidas. Si le atacan, infla su\ncuerpo para aumentar su contraataque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Odia la luce e gli shock. Se è attaccato, gonfia il\ncorpo per preparare il contrattacco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
