      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "まっくろな　しっぽを　かくすため\nくらやみで　ひっそりと　いきている。\nじぶんからは　こうげき　しない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "새까만 꼬리를 숨기기 위해\n어둠 속에서 은밀히 지내고 있다.\n자신이 먼저 공격하는 일은 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pour cacher sa queue noire, il vit discrètement dans\nl’obscurité. Il n’attaque jamais le premier.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt in der Dunkelheit, um seinen schwarzen\nSchweif zu verstecken. Es greift nie zuerst an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para mantener oculta su negra cola, vive en silencio\nen la oscuridad. Nunca ataca primero.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se ne sta sempre tranquillo al buio per nascondere la\ncoda nera come la pece. Non attacca mai per primo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "To keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in\nthe darkness. It is never first to attack.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "真っ黒な　尻尾を　隠すため\n暗闇で　ひっそりと　生きている。\n自分からは　攻撃しない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para mantener oculta su negra cola, vive en silencio\nen la oscuridad. Nunca ataca primero.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "２ひき　いじょう　あつまると　がまん　くらべを\nはじめるが　くうふくを　がまんして　しまうので\nソーナンス　トレーナーは　ちゅういが　ひつよう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "두 마리 이상 모이면 참기 겨루기를\n시작하는데 배고픔도 참아버리기 때문에\n마자용 트레이너는 주의가 필요하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si un ou plusieurs Qulbutoké se rencontrent, ils se mesurent\nles uns aux autres et font des concours d’endurance. Parfois,\nils tentent de voir qui peut rester le plus longtemps sans\nmanger. Mieux vaut être prévenu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn zwei oder mehr Woingenau aufeinandertreffen,\nversuchen sie, gegenseitig ihre Geduld zu übertreffen.\nSie möchten herausfinden, welches Pokémon es am längsten\nohne Nahrung aushält. Darauf müssen Trainer achten.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dos o más Wobbuffet se encuentran, se volverán\ncompetitivos e intentarán superarse en resistencia. Pero\ntambién puede que intenten aguantar sin comer; algo que\nlos Entrenadores deben tener muy en cuenta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando due o più Wobbuffet si incontrano, diventano\ncompetitivi tentando di vanificare la reciproca resistenza.\nTalvolta fanno anche a gara per vedere chi resiste di più\nsenza cibo. Gli Allenatori devono fare attenzione.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If two or more Wobbuffet meet, they will turn competitive\nand try to outdo each other’s endurance. However, they may\ntry to see which one can endure the longest without food.\nTrainers need to beware of this habit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "２匹　以上　集まると　我慢　比べを\n始めるが　空腹を　我慢して　しまうので\nソーナンス　トレーナーは　注意が　必要。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "omega-ruby",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/25/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dos o más Wobbuffet se encuentran, se volverán\ncompetitivos e intentarán superarse en resistencia. Pero\ntambién puede que intenten aguantar sin comer; algo que\nlos Entrenadores deben tener muy en cuenta.",
